{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07333","headline":"题王少府尧山隐处简陆鄱阳 · 刘长卿","name":"题王少府尧山隐处简陆鄱阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人沧洲吏，深与世情薄。\n解印二十年，委身在丘壑。\n买田楚山下，妻子自耕凿。\n羣动心有营，孤云本无着。\n因收谿上钓，遂接林中酌。\n对酒春日长，山村杏花落。\n陆生鄱阳令，独步建溪作。\n早晚休此官，随君永栖托。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}